                            Discover the significance of the Pakistan Monument, a national symbol commemorating the country's independence. Designed in the shape of a blooming flower, the monument represents the four provinces of Pakistan and the three territories. Explore the museum inside the monument, which showcases exhibits on Pakistan's history, culture, and heritage.
                        </p>
